1
00:00:02,938 --> 00:00:04,418
I'm Peppa Pig

2
00:00:05,058 --> 00:00:07,298
And this is my little brother, George

3
00:00:07,698 --> 00:00:09,578
This is Mummy Pig

4
00:00:10,018 --> 00:00:11,418
And this is Daddy Pig

5
00:00:13,738 --> 00:00:15,018
Peppa Pig

6
00:00:19,099 --> 00:00:20,983
"Traffic Jam"

7
00:00:22,179 --> 00:00:26,117
Grandpa Pig and Granny Pig are making lunch
for Peppa and her family

8
00:00:26,410 --> 00:00:28,998
I've dug up some more potatoes

9
00:00:29,818 --> 00:00:31,292
Oh, Grandpa

10
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:33,802
We have plenty of potatoes already

11
00:00:33,843 --> 00:00:36,861
You can never have too many potatoes

12
00:00:36,901 --> 00:00:37,861
All right

13
00:00:37,902 --> 00:00:39,902
But put them in the oven first

14
00:00:39,942 --> 00:00:41,782
They'll be here soon

15
00:00:42,383 --> 00:00:44,303
We have plenty of time

16
00:00:44,343 --> 00:00:46,424
It's only eleven o'clock

17
00:00:48,865 --> 00:00:50,985
Peppa and her family are on their way

18
00:00:51,225 --> 00:00:52,787
I wish we'd left earlier

19
00:00:52,827 --> 00:00:54,548
We're going to be late again

20
00:00:54,589 --> 00:00:56,629
It's fine, don't worry, Mummy

21
00:00:56,669 --> 00:00:58,831
We still have plenty of time

22
00:00:58,871 --> 00:01:00,779
Whenever we go to Granny and Grandpa's

23
00:01:00,819 --> 00:01:03,764
We're never on time, we're always late

24
00:01:04,275 --> 00:01:06,917
Not this time, I found a new way

25
00:01:07,037 --> 00:01:09,278
It avoids all the traffic

26
00:01:11,841 --> 00:01:13,602
I didn't expect this

27
00:01:13,642 --> 00:01:14,763
Because of a traffic jam

28
00:01:14,803 --> 00:01:16,884
Peppa and her family are stuck

29
00:01:17,558 --> 00:01:18,445
Look

30
00:01:18,485 --> 00:01:21,967
Danny and Granddad Dog are in front of us

31
00:01:22,007 --> 00:01:24,688
Danny and Granddad Dog are stuck in traffic too

32
00:01:24,728 --> 00:01:26,008
Hello, Peppa!

33
00:01:26,208 --> 00:01:27,610
Hello, Peppa!

34
00:01:28,729 --> 00:01:31,971
We're going to Granny and Grandpa's for lunch

35
00:01:32,064 --> 00:01:34,287
It looks like we're going to be late

36
00:01:36,980 --> 00:01:40,878
It's one o'clock already, and they're late again

37
00:01:40,919 --> 00:01:42,258
Just like always

38
00:01:42,299 --> 00:01:44,219
How are your potatoes coming along?

39
00:01:44,979 --> 00:01:47,699
They need to bake a bit longer

40
00:01:50,926 --> 00:01:52,578
Hello, Granny Pig speaking

41
00:01:52,618 --> 00:01:54,046
Hello, Granny

42
00:01:54,097 --> 00:01:56,257
We're stuck in traffic

43
00:01:56,297 --> 00:01:59,097
Don't worry, our lunch isn't ready yet anyway

44
00:01:59,137 --> 00:02:01,336
Grandpa made lots of potatoes today

45
00:02:01,456 --> 00:02:02,656
See you soon

46
00:02:03,296 --> 00:02:05,656
The whole family is still stuck in traffic

47
00:02:05,696 --> 00:02:09,616
Looks like I still have time
to go and dig up a few more potatoes

48
00:02:09,656 --> 00:02:10,816
Oh, Grandpa!

49
00:02:12,296 --> 00:02:14,976
We're moving so slowly

50
00:02:15,296 --> 00:02:18,336
We'll never get to Granny and Grandpa's

51
00:02:18,376 --> 00:02:20,976
Peppa's right, let's try another way

52
00:02:21,016 --> 00:02:23,177
But there isn't another main road

53
00:02:23,217 --> 00:02:24,777
I know a shortcut

54
00:02:26,615 --> 00:02:30,176
Bye-bye, everyone, we're taking a shortcut!

55
00:02:30,217 --> 00:02:31,497
Bye-bye, Peppa

56
00:02:31,538 --> 00:02:32,739
Good luck!

57
00:02:32,779 --> 00:02:34,860
Mummy Pig takes the shortcut

58
00:02:34,900 --> 00:02:36,452
Past all the other cars

59
00:02:36,651 --> 00:02:38,727
The shortcut is very bumpy

60
00:02:39,662 --> 00:02:41,063
This is fun!

61
00:02:42,664 --> 00:02:44,345
Are you sure this is the right way?

62
00:02:44,385 --> 00:02:45,145
Trust me

63
00:02:45,185 --> 00:02:46,506
Hello, ducks!

64
00:02:46,546 --> 00:02:48,667
We're taking a shortcut

65
00:02:53,072 --> 00:02:55,232
Look, straight back onto the main road

66
00:02:55,272 --> 00:02:57,032
Well done, Mummy!

67
00:02:58,593 --> 00:03:01,435
We're still behind Danny's truck

68
00:03:01,475 --> 00:03:02,112
Alright?

69
00:03:02,153 --> 00:03:03,740
Welcome back!

70
00:03:04,473 --> 00:03:05,393
Oh dear

71
00:03:05,434 --> 00:03:08,253
Mummy Pig's shortcut hasn't helped

72
00:03:11,323 --> 00:03:13,486
Right, lunch is ready

73
00:03:13,526 --> 00:03:16,690
And most importantly, the potatoes are baked

74
00:03:16,730 --> 00:03:18,102
And beautifully baked, too

75
00:03:18,143 --> 00:03:19,454
Lunch is ready

76
00:03:19,494 --> 00:03:22,258
but Peppa and her family haven't arrived yet

77
00:03:25,537 --> 00:03:27,615
Hello, Grandpa Pig speaking

78
00:03:27,698 --> 00:03:29,979
We're nearly at your house

79
00:03:30,060 --> 00:03:31,380
but there's still a big traffic jam

80
00:03:31,420 --> 00:03:33,662
The traffic is still moving at a snail's pace

81
00:03:33,702 --> 00:03:37,143
A very, very slow snail

82
00:03:38,544 --> 00:03:40,305
They're nearly here

83
00:03:40,345 --> 00:03:42,546
but they're still stuck in traffic and moving very slowly

84
00:03:42,586 --> 00:03:44,187
Poor things

85
00:03:44,227 --> 00:03:46,468
All the food laid out will get cold

86
00:03:46,508 --> 00:03:48,269
I have a wonderful idea

87
00:03:48,309 --> 00:03:50,710
I'll go and fetch the wheelbarrow

88
00:03:51,031 --> 00:03:53,074
What is Grandpa Pig going to do?

89
00:03:54,079 --> 00:03:54,959
Granny Pig

90
00:03:55,642 --> 00:03:59,210
Quick, put the lunch in the wheelbarrow

91
00:03:59,252 --> 00:04:00,934
Coming, Grandpa Pig

92
00:04:02,899 --> 00:04:05,659
If they can't come here for lunch

93
00:04:05,699 --> 00:04:08,059
we'll take lunch to them!

94
00:04:09,980 --> 00:04:10,940
Look!

95
00:04:11,180 --> 00:04:13,100
It's Grandpa and Granny Pig!

96
00:04:13,420 --> 00:04:16,060
They've brought our lunch in a wheelbarrow

97
00:04:16,820 --> 00:04:18,541
Don't drive off yet!

98
00:04:19,221 --> 00:04:21,701
Lunch has arrived!

99
00:04:21,866 --> 00:04:23,621
Is there enough lunch

100
00:04:23,661 --> 00:04:26,542
to share with Danny and Granddad Dog?

101
00:04:26,582 --> 00:04:28,825
There's plenty of food for everyone

102
00:04:28,865 --> 00:04:31,332
Hooray, potatoes!

103
00:04:32,505 --> 00:04:33,987
Well done, Grandpa!

104
00:04:34,027 --> 00:04:36,311
Good thing you made so many potatoes

105
00:04:37,110 --> 00:04:38,191
I told you so

106
00:04:38,231 --> 00:04:40,993
You can never have too many potatoes
